text.section:
Every licensee or its authorized delegate shall provide the sender a receipt for money received for transmission. The receipt shall contain, as applicable:

The name of the sender;


The name of the designated recipient;


The date of the transaction;


The unique transaction or identification number;


The name of the licensee, the licensee's NMLS Unique ID number, the licensee's business address, and the licensee's customer service telephone number;


The amount of money to be transmitted in United States dollars;


Any fee charged by the licensee to the sender for the transaction; and


Any taxes collected by the licensee from the sender for the transaction.
